evidence = "The last hf-done JSON and private evidence ledger name the exact verified content-derived candidate revision, command, exit code and log path; build and verify must pass on the same candidate revision. This record is finalized before qualification because embedding a candidate hash in its own content changes the hash. Only the external gate receipt establishes qualification; the runner publishes it without a manual commit or push."

